0\cellx3600\intbl\fs16 Single-variant item\cell\intbl\fs16 Normalized item code fallback\cell\row\pard\sa80\par\pard\sa1000s25 A2 conclusion\b0\par\pard\sa100\f0\fs19 Corrected source stock benchmark: source 498,551; run #2410 477,066; difference -21,485. The missing-code population carries only 22,714 pieces and does not reveal a missing-row problem in the thousands. Under the revised query rule, A2 does not block Stage B.\par\pard\sa100\f0\fs19 The investigation stopped after A2 as instructed, before making any multiplier override or plan-run changes. No development data was modified.\par}